    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Five pale timber planks in a welded black steel frame with a lower stretcher; every board has real thickness, confirmed in the front-left orbit and the top view. The bottom view shows the plank undersides and frame feet properly closed. Clean modern lines with convincing wood grain. Only 4.3k tris.",
    "limitations": [
      "Shelves are fixed and cannot be re-spaced without editing the mesh.",
      "Frame welds are not modelled, so extreme close-ups look simplified."
    ],
